{"id":"ostree-rev-parse.1","n":"ostree-rev-parse","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"ostree","ver":"2025.2-2.el9_6","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/o/ostree-2025.2-2.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/ostree-rev-parse.1.gz","sha256":"b4ba62090f6eb9643c82b97c3141f4f867241f77124534f9ed95ab9d00627f6a","date":"","origin":"OSTree"}},"nopt":{"r":1},"desc":"Output the target of a rev","r":[["NAME","<p>ostree-rev-parse - Output the target of a rev</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>ostree rev-parse </b> {REV} {PATH}</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--single</b>, <b>-S</b></dt><dd>If the repository has exactly one commit, then print it; any other case will result in an error.</dd></dl>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Given a REV, outputs the checksum of the latest commit of that revision.</p>"],["EXAMPLE","<p><b>$ ostree rev-parse my-branch</b></p>  <div class=\"in\"> <pre>\n<br>\n        ce19c41036cc45e49b0cecf6b157523c2105c4de1ce30101def1f759daafcc3e</pre> </div>"]]}